  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given reaction follows Hoffman bromamide&nbsp;degradation mechanism for the preparation of primary amines. In this reaction alkyl or aryl isocynate&nbsp;is formed as an intermediate. The formation of intermediate is shown below.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0086_002eb520f220.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 280px;\" /></p>"
